{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id113506310"}, "name":{"label":"Sim724"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-04-18T11:09:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"5.0.5"}, "id":{"label":"9835735390"}, "title":{"label":"Latest update a bit clunky"}, "content":{"label":"In general I very much like pedometer++ which I've been using since 2016, and credit the app with being a great help, along with dieting, in helping me get fitter and maintain my weight loss. My one issue since the recent update is the badges part of the app which seems quite clunky. For example this month I've done 18 days of reaching my goal, which the app recognises, but the monthly challenge badge has hung up at fifteen days and seems to be ignoring the remainder. This may sound a tad petty but it's very irritating in an app that I'm otherwise riveted to!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
